1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,909
Berapa ribu Alphard register

2
00:00:01,909 --> 00:00:04,364
di Malaysia setiap tahun?

3
00:00:04,364 --> 00:00:06,061
Tahun lepas, JPJ daftar

4
00:00:06,061 --> 00:00:08,727
tujuh belas ribu lebih Alphard.

5
00:00:08,727 --> 00:00:11,018
Itu empat puluh lapan sehari —

6
00:00:11,018 --> 00:00:13,091
dua buah setiap jam!

7
00:00:13,091 --> 00:00:15,000
Tahun dua ribu tujuh belas,

8
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:17,455
jumlahnya cuma dua ribu lebih.

9
00:00:17,455 --> 00:00:18,727
Empat tahun lepas,

10
00:00:18,727 --> 00:00:21,818
angka tu melompat dua kali ganda.

11
00:00:21,818 --> 00:00:24,364
Lepas tu, setiap tahun

12
00:00:24,364 --> 00:00:26,182
terus naik.

13
00:00:26,182 --> 00:00:28,091
Dalam senarai semua model,

14
00:00:28,091 --> 00:00:30,545
Alphard nombor tiga belas.

15
00:00:30,545 --> 00:00:32,932
Lebih banyak dari Honda Civic,

16
00:00:32,932 --> 00:00:34,909
malah Proton S70!

17
00:00:34,909 --> 00:00:35,545
Tapi...

18
00:00:35,545 --> 00:00:36,818
hampir semuanya

19
00:00:36,818 --> 00:00:39,273
cuma dua warna.

20
00:00:39,273 --> 00:00:41,455
Enam daripada sepuluh, putih.

21
00:00:41,455 --> 00:00:43,636
Lebih sepertiga, hitam.

22
00:00:43,636 --> 00:00:45,372
Jawapan: tujuh belas ribu lebih.

23
00:00:45,372 --> 00:00:48,000
Tahun ni, dah empat belas ribu.

24
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:49,909
Kalau kau beli,

25
00:00:49,909 --> 00:00:52,364
putih atau hitam?
